# ADR-006 - MVP Scope

## Status

Accepted

---

## Context

The collectible domain is extremely broad and includes action figures, vehicles, playsets, statues, model kits, trading cards, LEGO sets and many other product categories.

Attempting to model every collectible type from the beginning would significantly increase complexity and slow down development.

---

## Decision

The initial MVP will focus exclusively on:

- Action Figures
- Vehicles

The domain model must remain extensible, but no additional collectible categories will be modeled until they become actual project requirements.

---

## Consequences

The initial data model remains simple.

Future collectible categories may require new domain entities.

Architectural decisions should avoid preventing future expansion without introducing unnecessary abstractions today.